{"id":"39a84ca5e5beaeb5","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration-system.md","title":"ZFC Forcing Iteration System","display":"df-zfc-forcing-iteration-system — ZFC Forcing Iteration System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration-system","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration-system"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing-iteration-system — ZFC Forcing Iteration System","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing-iteration-system — ZFC Forcing Iteration System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d0dbf9d922eaa5eb\" href=\"?note=d0dbf9d922eaa5eb\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec{\\mathbb{P}},\\vec{\\mathbb{Q}},\\delta,\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit}\\in V\">\\(\\vec{\\mathbb{P}},\\vec{\\mathbb{Q}},\\delta,\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit}\\in V\\)</span> (iteration sequences, length, successor-step relation, and limit-support relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ForcingIterationSystem}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ForcingIterationSystem}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingIteration}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingIteration}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (forcing-iteration predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d0dbf9d922eaa5eb\" href=\"?note=d0dbf9d922eaa5eb\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}system} \\vdash \\mathrm{ForcingIterationSystem}_S(\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\vec{\\mathbb Q},\\delta,\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit}) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcingIteration}_S(\\delta,\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\vec{\\mathbb Q},\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}system} \\vdash \\mathrm{ForcingIterationSystem}_S(\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\vec{\\mathbb Q},\\delta,\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit}) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcingIteration}_S(\\delta,\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\vec{\\mathbb Q},\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This compatibility predicate preserves all five parameters of the canonical iteration predicate. In particular, successor forcing and the limit-support policy are data rather than hidden meta-level choices.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration.md","status":"resolved","id":"d0dbf9d922eaa5eb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration.md","status":"resolved","id":"d0dbf9d922eaa5eb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcForcingIteration}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (forcing-iteration predicate, see [[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\vec{\\mathbb{P}},\\vec{\\mathbb{Q}},\\delta,\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ForcingIterationSystem}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingIteration}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}system} \\vdash \\mathrm{ForcingIterationSystem}_S(\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\vec{\\mathbb Q},\\delta,\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit}) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcingIteration}_S(\\delta,\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\vec{\\mathbb Q},\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit})","display":true}],"bytes":1304,"backlinks":[{"id":"829c426641bc6abd","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ForcingIterationSystem}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (see [[58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration-system]]) and $\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[58-df-function]])."},{"id":"745cac2b74e2ba56","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"48fb34f5046bd3b9","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1964","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration-system.md|58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration-system]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d0dbf9d922eaa5eb"]}